{"title":"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A line has y-intercept <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/b/b3b8eb8e093d1d1c3834d880a7b448b3fa76eeab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> and forms a right angle to the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/1/bd1655959b0909181c3c0e6fc160a80082bf2c44.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x + y = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />. Find the x-intercept of the line.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/0/8f0fecf87705f2ee48861a9b66baf9a0d2ce7313.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\,(4,0)\\quad\\mathrm{(B)}\\,(6,0)\\quad\\mathrm{(C)}\\,(-4,0)\\quad\\mathrm{(D)}\\,(-6,0)\\quad\\mathrm{(E)}\\,\\text{none of the above}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"536\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The given line's equation is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/3/8e345834a8090006c4446016ef02a91d099b011b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = -2x + 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"98\" height=\"16\" />. Since the wanted line forms a right angle to the given line, the slopes of the two lines multiply to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />, so the slope of the wanted line is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/c/7acd90b4c509b85844a7fc33855fe060f2eb290f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"12\" height=\"23\" />. Thus, the equation of the wanted line is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/0/1602a871de8cd35d2da2b6bfa5d138e62933fa58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\tfrac12 x + 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"85\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nTo find the x-intercept of the line, substitute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/4/9d4f51e6f49c17d3c393a0c8b69428e15da97ac1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\tfrac12 x + 3 &amp;= 0 \\\\ \\tfrac12 x &amp;= -3 \\\\ x &amp;= -6 \\end{align*}\" width=\"97\" height=\"69\" />\nThe x-intercept of that line is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/2/8e23d414c99c22b7458b990cbc14c7790af91ec4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\,(-6,0)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"98\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest\" title=\"2006 iTest\">2006 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems\">(Problems</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 iTest Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/in